{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-05-02 09:00:00', 'title': 'SAP TO EMBED IBM WATSON ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE INTO SAP® SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'WALLDORF, GERMANY AND ARMONK, N.Y. , MAY 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SAP SE\xa0(NYSE: SAP) AND IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IBM WATSON® TECHNOLOGY WILL BE EMBEDDED INTO SAP® SOLUTIONS TO PROVIDE NEW AI-DRIVEN INSIGHTS AND AUTOMATION TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION AND CREATE MORE EFFICIENT AND EFFECTIVE USER EXPERIENCES ACROSS THE SAP APPLICATION PORTFOLIO.'}